{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "769a52b42ee21bdb49b6cb17cfbf05a3494dc39add96c75005e653ad101083f5", "ja": "あっ。{$P$}さーん！", "zh": "啊！{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a8086bbeb8a4d3c8697ac3bfeebb509016356612ead4db4daf917ccd0390587d", "ja": "青羽さん！　お疲れさまです。\n今日もお元気ですね！", "zh": "青羽小姐！辛苦了。\n你今天也很有精神呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "2821a1f96a84e9ad55e1d3cc70f7a5e0f0e1e9e66a4d318422054e30cd6d78aa", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪\nそれより、また社長さんがお呼びでしたよ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖♪\n对了，社长又有事情要找你啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "29cb693cbc1530f3ada7e4db3888fbe4706193791f108100c2b21152b57781cf", "ja": "本当ですか。教えてくれてありがとうございます！\n早速、行ってみますね！", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢你告诉我！\n我马上过去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "bc6732387c6585812d4b0b6c92d7962257ffe5b4407b759994a3f7c7f7672fe9", "ja": "はい！　カメ……。\nううん、いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好的！乌龟……\n没事，请慢走～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1005_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4d558a9559b7e510631cdcefd25579de4e2969f8839ee20b3a3afaec48be2dc1", "ja": "失礼します。\n社長、音無さん、おはようございます！", "zh": "打扰了。\n社长、音无小姐，早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "bbef7dc8c2f441ca9a76115d4c93768b504d4217765704f89163af122a011443", "ja": "おはようございます、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "早安，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "267ad8464e99f38e08f5492e0b7eb417bc6fe2680b42e78d65ea502938537077", "ja": "おはよう、君！\nうむ、今日もじつにいい笑顔だね。", "zh": "你早啊！\n嗯，今天的笑容也很灿烂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "044f40a7a6886b3446986d8be5f0233ac007fa526035e40bcb5f5707c0b56fd1", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さん。ケーキをどうぞ。\n海美ちゃんが差し入れてくれたんですよ♪", "zh": "来，{$P$}先生，请用蛋糕。\n这是海美拿来的慰劳品喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "15354be6f853f24d09284cc2bc24fe6d07a76c48312e90f3470d60009780bdc7", "ja": "海美が？　へえ、ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃ早速……うっ！", "zh": "海美拿来的？这样啊，谢谢。\n那我马上开动了……呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "eb03c7a01d966a5418a16dfba3c92b65c42eddfa35b0e8dc0530b7cf6a1e6a42", "ja": "これは、なんというか……\n尖った味ですね！", "zh": "这尝起来，该怎么形容呢……\n好独特的味道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "04fab6859df164f01b97d59b085b28c45bb5c057ce597a279ec53ffa617090a9", "ja": "そうそう、とってもスパイシーで\nおいしいですよね♪", "zh": "对啊对啊，味道很呛辣，\n非常好吃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "c174be2eb88f17408836e6515f5d84a54afb52e814fe61115ccde3fd59b16daa", "ja": "そうだな、ハッハッハ！\n……ところで、尖った、というと……。", "zh": "没错，哈哈哈！\n……对了，说到这个独特……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3c7973b49a6cd621dbd434dc23d7f19435644ad0b98e3dee7c0bc283489c1075", "ja": "ん？　社長、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "嗯？社长，请问怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "d5efb2e00fe8fd6e2bb504d53a95df5dee6364118584e02b08ff58c57e3ad0d1", "ja": "じつはまた、君に任せたい新しい仕事があってね。\n今回は、ちょっと尖ったものを目指している。", "zh": "其实我有件新的工作要交给你。\n这次的主旨就是比较独特的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "495f32a60223b7493721c0236e39948bb3e49ef28c9f3709f5a245dad0923b47", "ja": "尖ったもの……？", "zh": "独特的东西……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "26ffac7f3e5420b1cc3a250a0cdaa3460b05dffb7d8c5a8b56368558d4275901", "ja": "いやなに、懇意のTV局からの企画でね。\n特撮の魔法少女ものなのだが……。", "zh": "是这样的，跟我们关系良好的电视台提出一项企划。\n是魔法少女主题的特摄片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "1abfa62f695d6ffdcaf070fbddd26a3abc66f146fff6b8e8aecdf37027212372", "ja": "内容がじつに尖っているのだよ。そして、\n我が765プロの出演依頼が来た、というわけだ！", "zh": "企划的内容十分独特。\n而他们希望我们765艺能的偶像能够演出，就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f2694b22c2bce5a49254914a7a00706aa708bad7f037a83c78a1567f81198c1b", "ja": "なるほど、魔法少女ものですか！\n確かに、面白そうですね。", "zh": "原来如此，魔法少女是吧！\n听起来确实很有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "1032eab7bda567e33e698de6147ddd0956e696b0a9e5b08fd3a6c05985657af2", "ja": "もしかしたら、少し難しい仕事になるかもしれないが、\n大丈夫！　君ならできる！　……と、私は思っている！", "zh": "这工作可能会有点难度，\n不过放心！你一定办得到……我相信你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "6c6f9230647e99edcfa3b17d037b36ead7bb6b0b2639fddf5afbc8abff8ad6bf", "ja": "ええ、きっと{$P$}さんになら、\n軽々とこなせる仕事だと思います♪", "zh": "是啊，{$P$}先生\n一定可以轻松完成这份工作的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f70a55ae2a63232881b2cb0d844998c311da1c0f4fb25c6a73d767b1b8809888", "ja": "そ、そうですか。内容の尖り方が気になりますが……\nどんな仕事でも、断るつもりはありません。", "zh": "这、这样吗？其实我还挺好奇到底是怎么个独特法……\n不过无论是怎样的工作，我都不会拒绝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "fd7b50b35fa6dc3af47ef412962ff1c3053d93ad6fbff152e52aa4e2548ded31", "ja": "やりましょう！　その、特撮魔法少女ものを！", "zh": "我们就接下那个魔法少女特摄片吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "c6daad55012aee4576b3da74106f8f63356807c5fb619ea66fa95a55312ff26f", "ja": "おお、さすがは君だ！……期待しているからね。\n今回も存分に頑張ってくれたまえ！", "zh": "喔喔，不愧是你……我很期待你的表现喔。\n这次也要好好努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "6ba9ec2354c4fc86df0322ceb1ce24002763ac55a1eebc9d876559dec86861bd", "ja": "それじゃ、前祝いに海美ちゃんのケーキをもうひとつ♪\nまだまだたくさんありますから、パクッとどうぞ！", "zh": "那么，吃个海美的蛋糕来提前庆祝吧♪\n还有很多喔，大口大口吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5e1d2543123d524bc4344a0b29485016d1c3adc18514036b5b48469f02276c14", "ja": "あ、はい。いただきます……もぐもぐ……。\nうん、やっぱり尖ってます！", "zh": "啊，好的。我开动了……（嚼嚼）……\n嗯，味道真的非常独特！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0026_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0026_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "11bcceb936ab8e4710282a87de688150cb9dba7deae41295d591d6b012e3f7e4", "ja": "（尖った特撮魔法少女ものか。\n面白そうな企画だし、頑張っていこう！）", "zh": "（独特的魔法少女特摄片吗？\n感觉是个有趣的企划，加油吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
